# Org Events
An org's events, from someone's idea to a finished, quiet record.
Anyone in the org proposes one;  the Events Team's Managers say yes;  its organizers move it on.
Where they're kept is in OrgEvents.api.spell, and only its first line knows.
A move you may not make says why, and changes nothing.


## A row for each event:  where it is, and a button to move it on

<spell-more-of "event">
	<draw>
		<stack class="event" direction="horizontal" spacing="md" align="center" wrap>
			<text>{its name}</text>
			<label size="tiny">{its stage name}</label>
			<text color="grey">{its organizers}</text>
			<button class="move" size="small" disabled={its onward is ""} title="Move it on to its next stage" onClick={set its stage to its onward}>Move on</button>
		</stack>
	</draw>
</spell-more-of>

<spell-more-of "event stage">
	<draw>
		<stack class="stage" direction="horizontal" spacing="md" align="center" wrap>
			<text>{its name}</text>
			<text color="grey">{its moved by}</text>
		</stack>
	</draw>
</spell-more-of>


## The page:  a form to propose one, the events, and the stages they go through

<spell-app "events page">
	<property "new event" description="An event proposed:  its name, and its organizers' addresses, comma-separated">a new event</>

	<action "propose the new event">
		add the new event to the events
		set its new event to a new event
	</action>

	<draw>
		<container class="org-events">
			<stack>
				<header size="large">Events</header>
				<text color="grey">Propose one;  the Events Team says yes;  its organizers take it from there.</text>

				<segment class="propose">
					<header size="medium">Propose an event</header>
					<form value={its new event}>
						<stack direction="horizontal" wrap>
							<input name="name" placeholder="Picnic" aria-label="Its name" fluid/>
							<input name="organizers" placeholder="cy@rs, dee@rs" aria-label="Its organizers"/>
						</stack>
					</form>
					<button class="propose" color="primary" disabled={the name of the new event is ""} onClick={propose the new event}>Propose it</button>
				</segment>

				<segment class="events">
					<header size="medium">Events</header>
					<stack class="events" spacing="sm">
						<for event in every event loading="Finding the events">
							<empty><text class="none" color="grey">No events yet.</text></empty>
							<failed><text color="red">We can't read the events right now.</text></failed>
						</for>
					</stack>
				</segment>

				<segment class="stages">
					<header size="medium">Stages</header>
					<stack class="stages" spacing="sm">
						<for step in every event stage loading="Finding the stages"/>
					</stack>
				</segment>
			</stack>
		</container>
	</draw>
</spell-app>
